cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MRI Agent Bench, please cite it as below."
title: "MRI Agent Bench: a benchmark for AI agents on end-to-end MRI research"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Wang
    given-names: Ke
repository-code: "https://github.com/KeWang0622/MRIAgentBench"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
keywords:
  - MRI
  - benchmark
  - AI agents
  - evaluation
  - Bloch simulation
abstract: >-
  MRI Agent Bench tests whether AI agents can carry out end-to-end MRI research tasks and deliver results that hold up
  when checked independently. Graders replay exported sequences in a Bloch simulator, rerun submitted code on hidden
  data, compare maps with ground truth and recompute statistics. Research preview; task expert review remains pending.
